{"4177260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jumping Robo", "steam_appid": 4177260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ About the Game ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small robot lost in the vastness of space whispers a desperate wish:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“I just want to go home...”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only navigator for Jumping Robo, a lonely little robot who won't stop jumping in place—driven by its longing to return to Earth. Robo jumps automatically, non-stop. Your job is simple yet crucial: guide Robo safely by turning its direction at just the right time to avoid danger and land on safe tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget complex controls—Robo jumps on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just change direction with the arrow keys, dodge obstacles, and help Robo traverse countless planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/extras/76f81e3abedb833b4288f30dfdd6d77d.poster.avif?t=1766027538\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/extras/76f81e3abedb833b4288f30dfdd6d77d.webm?t=1766027538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/extras/76f81e3abedb833b4288f30dfdd6d77d.mp4?t=1766027538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Key Features ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive, Deep Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can pick up and play using just the arrow keys. But as you progress, you'll need sharp reflexes and the ability to read complex terrain. It's rhythm meets puzzle—play fast and light, or slow and calculated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visually Delightful Space Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-lit sci-fi cities to charming animations of round, bouncy Robo—every jump is a treat for the eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Core Mechanics ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Jumping Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button required. Robo bounces in rhythm on its own. Just focus on turning left or right at the right moment. It sounds simple—but fast speeds and tricky terrain will test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90 Unique Levels to Earth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path home is long and full of danger. From peaceful starter planets to extreme zones where one wrong move means falling into the void—get ready for 90 thrilling levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Gimmicks &amp; Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use or avoid directional arrows, jump pads, exploding mines, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on a rocket and blast through hazards for a thrilling ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ A Message to You, the Player ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo never stops jumping—but its journey depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each tap, you're drawing the shortest path home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you overcome countless planets and lead Robo safely to Earth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo’s already jumping. Are you ready to begin?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ About the Game ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small robot lost in the vastness of space whispers a desperate wish:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“I just want to go home...”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only navigator for Jumping Robo, a lonely little robot who won't stop jumping in place—driven by its longing to return to Earth. Robo jumps automatically, non-stop. Your job is simple yet crucial: guide Robo safely by turning its direction at just the right time to avoid danger and land on safe tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget complex controls—Robo jumps on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just change direction with the arrow keys, dodge obstacles, and help Robo traverse countless planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/extras/76f81e3abedb833b4288f30dfdd6d77d.poster.avif?t=1766027538\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/extras/76f81e3abedb833b4288f30dfdd6d77d.webm?t=1766027538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/extras/76f81e3abedb833b4288f30dfdd6d77d.mp4?t=1766027538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Key Features ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive, Deep Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can pick up and play using just the arrow keys. But as you progress, you'll need sharp reflexes and the ability to read complex terrain. It's rhythm meets puzzle—play fast and light, or slow and calculated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visually Delightful Space Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-lit sci-fi cities to charming animations of round, bouncy Robo—every jump is a treat for the eyes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Core Mechanics ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Jumping Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button required. Robo bounces in rhythm on its own. Just focus on turning left or right at the right moment. It sounds simple—but fast speeds and tricky terrain will test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90 Unique Levels to Earth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path home is long and full of danger. From peaceful starter planets to extreme zones where one wrong move means falling into the void—get ready for 90 thrilling levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>* Gimmicks &amp; Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use or avoid directional arrows, jump pads, exploding mines, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on a rocket and blast through hazards for a thrilling ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ A Message to You, the Player ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo never stops jumping—but its journey depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each tap, you're drawing the shortest path home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you overcome countless planets and lead Robo safely to Earth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo’s already jumping. Are you ready to begin?</p>", "short_description": "Robo never stops jumping—but its journey depends on you. With each tap, you're drawing the shortest path home. Will you overcome countless planets and lead Robo safely to Earth?", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/5a8115765edace440a1651399a19b956315af174/header.jpg?t=1766027538", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/ac2874bc7fb7129ce91ab36be36b82e2efa93c1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766027538", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177260/ac2874bc7fb7129ce91ab36be36b82e2efa93c1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766027538", "website": "http://dandangames.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>